id: pm-vzcisw
title: "MCP 2026-07-28 deprecation and removal migration: roots, sampling, logging, dynamic registration, HTTP+SSE, includeContext, ping, and legacy sessions"
description: Remove canonical use of deleted protocol methods and migrate every deprecated feature to the specified replacement while preserving only bounded evidence-backed compatibility adapters.
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[8]: "area:mcp",compatibility,deprecation,http-sse,logging,migration,roots,sampling
created_at: "2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z"
