  "2026-08-25T19:16:17.245Z","harness:codex","Execution scope: generated legacy-symbol inventory and CI gate, canonical removal of session-era methods and headers, explicit bounded legacy adapter policy, protocol-era tests, docs, and release evidence."
  "2026-08-25T19:54:45.151Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: isolated every supported 2025-06-18 behavior in LegacyMcpAdapter, kept the modern dispatcher sessionless, and added a generated source/test/doc inventory that fails on canonical removed or deprecated symbols. Current inventory has zero canonical violations; the migration guide records replacement behavior and an earliest 2027-07-28 deprecated-feature sunset, while legacy stdio removal still requires two clean consumer windows."
  "2026-08-25T20:04:23.928Z","harness:codex","Full-suite correction evidence: the first 7,975-test coverage run found only governed-inventory drift from the new mandatory gate. Updated the canonical quality command golden and retained the central gate-registry migration-majority policy by naming this a generated inventory invoked from quality:static. The four targeted failures now pass (67/67)."
  "2026-08-25T21:13:13.574Z","harness:codex","Evidence: extracted the legacy adapter behind canonical 2026-07-28 paths, delegated the old pm_subscribe surface, documented sunset/migration policy, and added the governed deprecation inventory ratchet. Inventory passed with 40 classified references: 1 legacy adapter, 14 migration references, 22 negative tests, 3 bounded tests, and 0 unclassified canonical references. Exact repository verification passed 581 files / 7,982 tests at 100/100/100/100; static quality, lint, typecheck, release contract, package, npx, and dogfood gates passed."
  "2026-08-25T22:57:39.971Z","harness:codex","Hosted-review remediation evidence (final code before close): replaced the generic source-marker bypass with an exact path+rule+source-line single-use allowlist. The final MCP deprecation inventory reports 40 findings: 1 legacy adapter, 14 migration-document references, 22 negative controls, 3 bounded source controls, and 0 canonical violations. Exact local proof: focused gate tests passed, 581 files / 7,990 tests reached exact 100% coverage, and the complete lint/static chain exited 0."
  "2026-08-25T23:00:42.284Z","harness:codex","Final linked-test execution after hosted-review remediation: the deprecation/handshake/stateless suite passed 50/50 tests and the live deprecation inventory gate passed with zero canonical violations."
  "2026-08-26T01:38:18.143Z","harness:codex","Final exact-head hosted-review remediation evidence before close: the remote transport security guide now documents bounded_source_control as the fifth inventory disposition and states that it is limited to exact single-use lines in the reviewed fixed allowlist. The live inventory remains 40 findings: 1 legacy adapter, 14 migration docs, 22 negative controls, 3 bounded source controls, and 0 canonical violations. Exact full coverage and full lint/static assurance passed; both linked deprecation checks passed, including 50/50 focused tests."
  "2026-08-26T01:39:07.603Z","harness:codex","Closure repair evidence before close: restored recurrence-current resolution, expected result, and actual result after the reopen lifecycle cleared prior terminal fields; all previously recorded final tests remain unchanged and passing."
